{title: 011 - The God of Abraham Praise}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #011 • LEONI • 7.6.8.4.6.7.7.4}
{lyricist: Thomas Olivers}
{composer: Meyer Lyon}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 11}
{meta: tune LEONI}
{meta: meter 7.6.8.4.6.7.7.4}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Em]The God of [D#m]Abraham [Bm]praise,
[G/B]Who reigns [Am/C]enthroned [Bm]above;
[D]Ancient [G]of [Bm]everlasting [G]days,
[C/E]And [Bm]God [D7]of [Em]love;
[C]Jehovah! [D]Great I [G]AM!
[G]By earth and heaven [B7/D#]confessed;
[Bm]I [D]bow [B7/D#]and bless [Em]the [C]sacred name,
[Am]Forever [Bm]blest.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Em]The God of [D#m]Abraham [Bm]praise,
[G/B]At whose [Am/C]supreme [Bm]command
[D]From earth [G]I [Bm]rise, [Em]and seek [D]the [G]joys
[C/E]At [Bm]His [D7]right [Em]hand;
[C]I all [G/D]on [D]earth forsake,
[G]Its wisdom, fame [B7/D#]and power;
[Bm]And [D]Him [B7/D#]my only [Em]portion [C]make,
[Am]My shield and [Bm]tower.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Em]The whole triumphant [Bm]host
[G/B]Give thanks [Am/C]to [Bm]God on [Am]high;
[D]"Hail, Father, [Bm]Son, [Em]and Holy [G]Ghost!"
[C/E]They [Bm]ever [Em]cry;
[C]Hail, Abraham's [D]God and [G]mine!
[G]I join the heavenly [Em]lays;
[Bm]All [D]might [B7/D#]and majesty [C]are Thine,
[Am]And endless [Bm]praise.
{end_of_verse}
